      - Seq: 2
        Type: say
        Actor: shiba
        DialogueId: dlg_np_shiba_1_002
        Arg: idle
        Text:
          <Ko>k__BackingField: "\uBB58 \uBD10? \uC2DC\uBC14."
          <En>k__BackingField: What're you looking at? Shiba.
        When: 
        Effects: 
        Sync: wait
        SceneId: 
        Options: []
      - Seq: 3
        Type: say
        Actor: luna
        DialogueId: dlg_np_shiba_1_003
        Arg: idle
        Text:
          <Ko>k__BackingField: "\uC548\uB155\uD558\uC138\uC694."
          <En>k__BackingField: Hello.
        When: 
        Effects: 
        Sync: wait
        SceneId: 
        Options: []
      - Seq: 4
        Type: say
        Actor: shiba
        DialogueId: dlg_np_shiba_1_004
        Arg: idle
        Text:
          <Ko>k__BackingField: "\uD558. \uC774 \uB3D9\uB124\uC5D0\uC11C \uC778\uC0AC\uD558\uACE0\n\uB3CC\uC544\uB2E4\uB2C8\uB294
            \uB188\uC774 \uC788\uB124."
          <En>k__BackingField: 'Ha. Someone in this neighborhood

            actually
            goes around greeting people.'
        When: 
        Effects: 
        Sync: wait
        SceneId: 
        Options: []
      - Seq: 5
        Type: say
        Actor: luna
        DialogueId: dlg_np_shiba_1_005
        Arg: idle
        Text:
          <Ko>k__BackingField: "\uD639\uC2DC \uC778\uAC04\uC785\uB2C8\uAE4C?"
          <En>k__BackingField: Are you, by any chance, human?
        When: 
        Effects: 
        Sync: wait
        SceneId: 
        Options: []
      - Seq: 6
        Type: say
        Actor: shiba
        DialogueId: dlg_np_shiba_1_006
        Arg: idle
        Text:
          <Ko>k__BackingField: "\uBB50\uB798, \uB108 \uBA38\uB9AC \uB098\uC058\uB0D0?"
          <En>k__BackingField: What? Are you slow or something?
        When: 
        Effects: 
        Sync: wait
        SceneId: 
        Options: []
      - Seq: 7
        Type: say
        Actor: luna
        DialogueId: dlg_np_shiba_1_007
        Arg: idle
        Text:
          <Ko>k__BackingField: "\uC721\uC548\uC73C\uB85C \uBD24\uC744 \uB54C \uAC15\uC544\uC9C0\uB85C
            \uD310\uB2E8\uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4."
          <En>k__BackingField: 'Visual assessment indicates: dog.'
        When: 
        Effects: 
        Sync: wait
        SceneId: 
        Options: []
      - Seq: 8
        Type: say
        Actor: shiba
        DialogueId: dlg_np_shiba_1_008
        Arg: idle
        Text:
          <Ko>k__BackingField: "\uC0AC\uB78C\uC744 \uC5BC\uAD74\uB85C \uD310\uB2E8\uD558\uC9C0
            \uB9D0\uB77C\uACE0.\n\uBABB\uC0DD\uAE34 \uB188 \uAC19\uC73C\uB2C8."
          <En>k__BackingField: 'Don''t judge people by their faces,

            you
            ugly mug.'
        When: 
        Effects: 
        Sync: wait
        SceneId: 
        Options: []
      - Seq: 9
        Type: say
        Actor: luna
        DialogueId: dlg_np_shiba_1_009
        Arg: idle
        Text:
          <Ko>k__BackingField: "\u2026\uADF8\uB7FC \uC0AC\uB78C\uC774 \uB9DE\uB294
            \uAC74\uAC00\uC694?"
          <En>k__BackingField: ...So you ARE a person?
